        "date": "2026-10-27T03:12:49Z"
      },
      "message": "Add skip_distance and checked_in_at options to EventCheckIn.\n\nofficers need to import attendance after an event when there's no live device location to compare against and the real check-in time comes from the uploaded file rather than when the file is imported.\n\nRather than duplicate EventCheckIn's award logic, it can bypass the proximity check with skip_distance, and supply a recorded time with another caller with checked_in_at.\n\nDuplicate guard and with_lock serialization stay unconditional regardless of skip_distance so it prevents a member being counted twice.\n\nPoint award still uses Date.current, so it matches every other award on the app.",
