      },
      "message": "Add AttendanceImport parser, mapper, and executor services.\n\nOfficers need to upload an attendance for a single event and have each attendee matched to a member, with points awarded as if they've checked in. These services match the other imports.\n\nImports partial rows instead of an all-or-nothing. Every row is processed with EventCheckIn with skip_distance and its recorded time. Rejected errors are recorded for a row and continues.\n\nDuplicate and already-checked-in detection is only in EventCheckIn, so re-uploads produce the same message and nothing is counted twice. File-level validation is on the next commit.",
