      },
      "message": "Add attendance import screen with event picker and results.\n\nOfficers need to pick an event, upload a csv or xlsx of attendees, and see how many attendance records were saved along with any rows that could not be saved. Files have no event column, so the event is chosen before the upload.\n\nFile level problems (wrong ext., missing checked in or email columns) stop before any row runs, so nothing is saved and the message names the problem.\n\nRow-level problems come back from the executor and are shown in a results table with the spreadsheet row number and reason, while valid rows stay saved.\n\nResults are handed off and shown on a GET so refreshing doesn't re-run imports.",
