        "date": "2026-10-27T05:24:54Z"
      },
      "message": "Adds feature specs for attendance import.\n\nCovers an officer uploading a file, seeing the saved count, members' total and per-type points and active status reflect the imported attendance.\n\nFile-level problems (wrong ext., missing cols, unreadable files) save nothing and name the problem, and row-level problems save valid rows while listing each bad row with its number and reason. Re-uploading the same file saves nothing twice, and a non-admin has no access.\n\nTests flips a member's status through real threshold, so it reflects how status is computed in reality instead of asserts in isolation. Keyboard behavior and select-then-navigate is tested via browser test.",
